 1919                   	LD HL,PHSBUF
 1920                   
 1921                   	; LBA0..7 -> C
 1922                   	LD A,(IOS)
 1923                   	SLA A		; make room for 4 disks (0 to 3, 2 bits)
 1924                   	SLA A
 1925                   	LD B,A
